    {
      "_id": "mV5iDHzPFIvNEXul",
      "name": "Slow {@recharge 5}",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/sword.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The nullifier targets one creature it can see within 10 feet of it. The creature must make a DC 13 Wisdom saving throw against this magic. On a failed save, the creature can't use reactions, its speed is halved, and it can't make more than one attack on its turn. In addition, the creature can take either an action or a bonus action on its turn, not both. The effect lasts for 1 minute. The creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns.</p>",
